      "value": "So VRChat supports two players, one built in to unity, and AVPro, AVPro is configured to use Windows Media Foundation (WMF)\n\nIf WMF has a bug might want to file against that. \n\nI have tried to find another app that uses WMF but all I could find last time I looked was some example code",
