      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I want to add a note to this - this does not occur in editor via VideoPlayerShim, which utilizes AVPro 2.8.5, and has no issue playing with WMF (via Windows Media Player) - this quirk only exists in VRC at runtime. So it likely exists in whatever changes VRChat has made to AVPro.\n\nThis also prevents MPEG-DASH from playing back smoothly, not just LL-HLS and otherwise modern HLS.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
