      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b4cfe34e2f8bb53f6847f7b|full_name} There appears to be an issue with VRChat playback when using MediaMTX in HLS with FMP4 and lowLatency mode, as there is no sound. Since these modes utilize DASH for streaming, and TS incurs a delay of more than 10 seconds, I hope VRChat will consider supporting and resolving this problem in future updates",
      "viewerReactions": null,
