  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-10-10T13:47:37.448Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "An issue have encountered while using VRChat play fmp4 video on PC. When playing fMP4 m3u8 videos, we experience intermittent stuttering. However, this issue does not occur when playing TS m3u8 videos.\n\n﻿\n\nWe have conducted multiple tests with several users, and the problem persists consistently across different setups. This suggests that the issue is specific to the fMP4 format.\n\nWe would appreciate it if your team could investigate this matter and provide a solution. Thank you for your attention to this issue.",
